{"id": "EUVD-2026-96588", "enisaUuid": "589722f3-0238-3cf8-bc82-deda8af42495", "description": "JeecgBoot through 3.9.5 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the queryUserRolesById handler of SystemApiController that lets authenticated users read any user's role codes. Low-privileged attackers can send a userId to GET /sys/api/queryUserRolesById to enumerate role assignments and identify administrator accounts.", "datePublished": "2026-10-10T21:49:38", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T12:39:08", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/JeecgBoot/poc_sys_api_user_roles_by_id.py", "https://github.com/jeecgboot/JeecgBoot/blob/e3b9dc0aefe1943d9772b026f64ed671a7c82802/jeecg-boot/jeecg-module-system/jeecg-system-biz/src/main/java/org/jeecg/modules/api/controller/SystemApiController.java#L482-L485", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jeecgboot-through-3.9.5-missing-authorization-via-sys-api-queryuserrolesbyid"], "aliases": ["GHSA-8qxr-46x4-p4xq", "CVE-2026-108649"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "294eb37c-5594-3ccb-bd13-c83473d377c3", "product": {"name": "JeecgBoot", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.9.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "9e203bf5-621a-3550-878e-b691aebe376f", "vendor": {"name": "jeecgboot"}}], "isExploited": false}